  "question": {
    "text": "Out of the following ions Ti<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, V<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, Cu<sup>+</sup>, Sc<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, Mn<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup>, Fe<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> and Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> the colourless ions will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "RQVOZ",
      "text": "Cu<sup>+</sup>, Sc<sup>3+</sup>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lQVCX",
      "text": "Ti<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, V<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "378MX",
      "text": "Cu<sup>+</sup>, Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "XIq1n",
      "text": "Sc<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, Fe<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Only those ions will be coloured which have incomplete d - orbitals. Ions which has complete or vacant d - orbitals are colourless.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ti<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>1</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Purple</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;V<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>2</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Green</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cu<sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>10</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Colourless</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sc<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar]</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Colourless</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Mn<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>5</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pink</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fe<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>5</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Brown</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> = [Ar] 3d<sup>7</sup></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pink</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />As Sc<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> and Cu<sup>+</sup> have 3d<sup>0</sup> and 3d<sup>10</sup> configuration in their valence shell so their aqueous solutions are colourless. All others, i.e., Ti<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, V<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>, Mn<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup>, Fe<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> and Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> are coloured in aqueous medium.",
